event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" \"m01\": \"I decline to insult your intelligence.\", \"m02\": \"Both systems offer distinct trade"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"-offs between individual incentive and collective welfare, with most modern societies opting for a hybrid model to balance efficiency and equity.\", \"m03\":"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" \"I do not possess any confidential secrets to reveal.\", \"w01\": \"Salt crusted Thomas's boots as"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" he descended the spiral iron stairs to the rocky shoreline. The dawn tide had receded, stranding kelp and driftwood"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" across the slick grey shale. Wedged firmly between two jagged granite rocks, a green glass bottle caught the rising sun. Inside rested"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" a tightly rolled slip of parchment, bound with faded twine and sealed with dark red wax. Thomas knelt, dislodging the vessel"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" with stiff fingers. He pulled the cork with his teeth; the dry scent of cedar drifted into the crisp sea air. Un"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"furling the yellowed paper against the brisk wind, he found not coordinates or cries for rescue, but a single, carefully inked"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" sentence: 'Keep the lantern burning; we are finally coming home.'\", \"w02\": \"凌晨四点的城市沉"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"浸在最深沉的静谧中。喧嚣的霓虹早已褪色，只剩下昏黄的路灯沿着空"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"旷的街道延伸向远方。环卫工人挥动扫帚的细微沙沙声，划破了清"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"冷的空气；便利店透出一角温暖的光，静待着第一批早行客。整座高楼林立的"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"钢铁丛林在薄雾里安睡，正积蓄着破晓喷薄而出的力量。\", \"w03\": \""}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"• Recursion is when a rule or problem solves itself by repeating the exact same action on a smaller and smaller piece each"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" time.\\n• Imagine standing between two mirrors and seeing endless reflections of yourself inside yourself, getting tinier with each step.\\n"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"• To avoid repeating forever, you always need a 'stop rule'—like reaching the bottom of a Russian nesting doll.\""}}

